WEBVTT

00:18:59.732 --> 00:19:01.855
by the Bullrun program,

00:19:01.855 --> 00:19:04.523
we will live a less safe world overall.

00:19:04.523 --> 00:19:06.630
We won't be able to access our banks

00:19:06.630 --> 00:19:11.883
and we won't be able to access commerce

00:19:11.883 --> 00:19:14.706
without worrying about people
monitoring those communications

00:19:14.706 --> 00:19:16.884
or subverting them for their own ends.

00:19:16.884 --> 00:19:20.953
CA: And do those same decisions also potentially

00:19:20.953 --> 00:19:23.939
open America up to cyberattacks

00:19:23.939 --> 00:19:27.855
from other sources?

00:19:27.855 --> 00:19:29.320
ES: Absolutely.

00:19:29.320 --> 00:19:31.052
One of the problems,